      "line_no": 11,
      "code": "     FROM boats B)",
      "explanation": ""
    },
    {
      "line_no": 12,
      "code": "     < 100));",
      "explanation": "The summed results of two subqueries is compared with '100' and if the value is less than 100, the condition is satisfied. "
